{
  "name": "Highlander Style",
  "type": "skill",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Effective when you are equipped with a [Two-Handed] weapon. You will gain + [POW mod] on the damage roll done for the round you declared [Standby].&nbsp;</p>\n<p>(SR 2): When you are in the [Pre-Action] state, increase your [Dodge Check] by 1.&nbsp;<br>(SR 3): When you declare [Standby], you instantly lose 1 [Hate].</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A fighting style that uses a powerful blow with a large weapon. The power of the blow that is fired after building up power is second to none.</p>",
